{"adverse_evidence": null, "authority": "authority/source/descent.tex", "authority_sha256": "49483B3BCB36427A607A8227F4EA67730FCDDF1EECCB8E992CA61915ACE3B31D", "class": "source_defect", "locus": "descent.tex:7718", "operations": [{"class": "source_defect", "declared_line_occurrences": 1, "end_byte_exclusive": 293251, "file_occurrences": 1, "line": 7718, "old_bytes": 168, "old_sha256": "E39AC20A81D6CC7A0E582A455B45E04FDA2B003C9E412520DFFF9E8256D4BE0F", "old_text": "Since $\\mathcal{P}$ is \\'etale local on the source we see\nthat $x \\in W(f)$ if and only if the image of $x$ in\n$X \\times_Y Y'$ is in $W(X \\times_Y Y' \\to Y')$. Hence we", "operation_id": "MC-STK-ERR-1416-OP1", "origin": "producer_packet_and_independent_adjudication", "producer_id": "DESCENT-027", "producer_operation_id": "DESCENT-027-OP1", "replacement_bytes": 171, "replacement_sha256": "9C510ECDE58229400ED4941343C389BB10A986B953B2DECB4B85584242B58986", "replacement_text": "Since $\\mathcal{P}$ is \\'etale local on the source we see\nthat $x' \\in W(f')$ if and only if the image of $x'$ in\n$X \\times_Y Y'$ is in $W(X \\times_Y Y' \\to Y')$. Hence we", "source": "descent.tex", "source_end_line": 7720, "source_start_line": 7718, "stable_id": "MC-STK-ERR-1416", "start_byte": 293083}], "payload": "payload/descent.tex", "producer_aliases": [], "producer_id": "DESCENT-027", "producer_ids": ["DESCENT-027"], "proof": "For the etale morphism X'->X times_Y Y' at x', source locality compares x' in W(f') with its image in the base-change open. The point x alone has no chosen lift to the fibre product, and x in W(f) is the conclusion still being proved.", "schema": "mathematics-commons-stacks-source-map/v2", "source": "descent.tex", "unit_id": "MC-STK-ERR-1416"}
